<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Ciba SC.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Ciba SC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. in New York, Frankfurt has issued 15 million American-style call and put warrants, in three equal tranches, on Ciba Speciality Chemicals, lead manager Citibank (Switzerland), Zurich said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXEPIRATION     27.MAR.98		 PAYDATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100			 SPOT REF   108.86 CHF</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	    STRIKE	ISSUE     PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL	    110 CHF     1.30 CHF  12.6 PCT</p>
<p> CALL	    125 CHF     0.76 CHF  21.43 PCT</p>
<p> PUT	     100 CHF     0.75 CHF  15.3 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
